# withdrawal sequences:
#   tests/pins/public-safety/review/declaration-conflict-withdraws-requisition/expect.pins.nibli
#   tests/pins/public-safety/review/defence-structure-conflict-withdraws-force-abroad/expect.pins.nibli
# Each completes the parent record and the measure built on it, asserts an
# independently reviewed defect against the parent, and then neither record
# completes, while the person named in the measure keeps personhood and the
# floor debt and is not a prisoner. The operators' duties continue under the
# recorded undertakings: to notify the Assembly and the Constitutional Court
# and preserve immediate challenge, to inventory, return or compensate
# requisitioned property, and to keep defence within the Assembly's ceilings,
# appropriations and audit. They do not establish that property was returned,
# that a deployment ended, or that any remedy was performed.
